# Project Requirements

## Software Requirements

• Python 3.8 or higher
• Visual Studio Code or any Python IDE
• Windows Operating System (or equivalent)

## Python Libraries

• numpy
• pandas
• tensorflow
• scikit-learn
• matplotlib

## Hardware Requirements

• Minimum 8 GB RAM recommended
• Intel i5 or equivalent processor
• Sufficient storage space for project files

## Functional Requirements

• Time series data generation
• Sequence creation for LSTM input
• Model training and prediction
• Uncertainty estimation using MC Dropout
• Performance evaluation
• Visualization of forecast results

## Non-Functional Requirements

• Efficient execution
• Accuracy in prediction
• Easy maintainability
• Code modularity

## Installation Instructions

• Install Python
• Install required libraries using pip
• Setup project directory structure
• Run main.py from root folder

## Usage

• Execute the main script
• View training progress
• Observe prediction metrics
• Analyze forecast plot

## Maintenance

• Update dependencies when required
• Modify sequence length or model parameters for tuning
